. Leonardo DiCaprio stars as Frank, a charismatic high-schooler whose parents’ divorce and his father’s financial troubles send him running away with little more than a checkbook. He quickly discovers a talent for forgery and impersonation, cashing millions in fake checks while posing as a Pan Am pilot, a pediatrician, and a lawyer. Tom Hanks plays the dogged FBI agent Carl Hanratty, whose years-long pursuit of Frank becomes a cat-and-mouse game that stretches across the United States and Europe. The film balances lighthearted caper energy with the emotional fallout of a fractured family, showing how Frank’s cons serve as both an escape and an attempt to recapture the stability he lost.\n\nSpielberg’s polished, 1960s-period production features a memorable John Williams score and strong supporting turns from Christopher Walken as Frank’s charming but failing father and Amy Adams as the nurse Frank falls for. Made on a $52 million budget, the movie opened on Christmas Day 2002 and went on to earn more than $352 million worldwide. Critics praised DiCaprio’s magnetic performance and the film’s mix of humor and pathos; it earned Academy Award nominations for Walken’s supporting work and Williams’s score, along with several other honors. The story ends on a note of redemption, with Frank later using his expertise to help catch other forgers, turning the same skills that once made him a fugitive into a legitimate career.","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_e0866a15793cc061440acc9faec0","publishedAt":"2026-09-19T06:01:51.000Z","profileId":"prf_8e4effdf5a4f054b8972fa562914","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":26819563,"likesCount":551352,"sharesCount":23087,"commentsCount":834,"interactionsCount":575273,"engagementRatePerViews":2.1449752928487316,"engagementRatePerFollowers":3.562076035471596,"profileFollowersCount":16149936,"profileFollowingCount":374,"profilePostsCount":5396,"mediaCount":1,"duration":36.733,"hashtags":[],"coAuthors":[],"mentions":[],"platformId":"DddUV9zzbiN","profilePlatformId":"1415356583","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/wasted/pfp.webp","profileBio":"The Original @Wasted 🔌 \nMemes | Funny Videos | News\n📨 info@wasted.media\nSubmit your vids here👇","profileVerified":true,"locationPlatformId":null,"locationCompleteAddress":null,"locationLatitude":null,"locationLongitude":null,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"More coffee, sir? Are you a collector? What are you talking about? Barry Allen. The Flash. But kid, kid, kid, you mean like the comic book? Yeah, the comic book. I mean, it's not The Flash. It's the name Barry Allen. Thank you. Now get this, he reads comic books. The comic book, Barry Allen is The Flash. Oh, slow down, Scott. I don't know if I can talk about it. He's a kid. Our unsub is a kid. That's why we couldn't match Prince. That's why he doesn't have a record.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.068,"endSeconds":2.067,"text":"More coffee, sir?"},{"startSeconds":4.308,"endSeconds":6.308,"text":"Are you a collector?"},{"startSeconds":6.308,"endSeconds":8.308,"text":"What are you talking about?"},{"startSeconds":8.308,"endSeconds":10.308,"text":"Barry Allen."},{"startSeconds":10.308,"endSeconds":12.308,"text":"The Flash."},{"startSeconds":12.308,"endSeconds":16.308,"text":"But kid, kid, kid, you mean like the comic book?"},{"startSeconds":16.308,"endSeconds":17.308,"text":"Yeah, the comic book."},{"startSeconds":17.308,"endSeconds":18.308,"text":"I mean, it's not The Flash."},{"startSeconds":18.308,"endSeconds":20.308,"text":"It's the name Barry Allen."},{"startSeconds":20.308,"endSeconds":22.308,"text":"Thank you."},{"startSeconds":24.308,"endSeconds":27.508,"text":"Now get this, he reads comic books."},{"startSeconds":27.508,"endSeconds":30.067,"text":"The comic book, Barry Allen is The Flash."},{"startSeconds":30.067,"endSeconds":31.108,"text":"Oh, slow down, Scott."},{"startSeconds":31.108,"endSeconds":32.308,"text":"I don't know if I can talk about it."},{"startSeconds":32.308,"endSeconds":33.268,"text":"He's a kid."},{"startSeconds":33.268,"endSeconds":34.268,"text":"Our unsub is a kid."},{"startSeconds":34.268,"endSeconds":35.668,"text":"That's why we couldn't match Prince."},{"startSeconds":35.668,"endSeconds":37.268,"text":"That's why he doesn't have a record."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_64d171b020ce445273e01c701ac1","position":1,"timestampSeconds":3.07,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/1_3.07.webp"},{"id":"med_673354375cf5ce187d1f8343e106","position":2,"timestampSeconds":4.27,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/2_4.27.webp"},{"id":"med_fdea3ae15b5cdc94e386f6249c33","position":3,"timestampSeconds":5.73,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/3_5.73.webp"},{"id":"med_ab7fc62332a5667a53d81e9fe00d","position":4,"timestampSeconds":7.4,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/4_7.40.webp"},{"id":"med_4a7e466af7153f68b63269f67826","position":5,"timestampSeconds":8.17,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/5_8.17.webp"},{"id":"med_aafed81e579da342555efe857413","position":6,"timestampSeconds":8.83,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/6_8.83.webp"},{"id":"med_0c40455d9f6ea05e3d5f5652a3d0","position":7,"timestampSeconds":9.53,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/7_9.53.webp"},{"id":"med_027e43e3d73ed8a3387a25d2bb95","position":8,"timestampSeconds":10.77,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/DddUV9zzbiN/8_10.77.webp"},{"id":"med_1ae9123c18b17e0792eadcef2f8d","position":9,"timestampSeco